<Positioned left="86.00" top="914.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· cumulogenitus 积云性（积云铺展而成）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="392.00" top="808.00" width="280.00" height="22.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="13.5" color="#C75B39" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">变种 varieties · 7</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="392.00" top="836.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· translucidus 透光 / perlucidus 漏光</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="392.00" top="862.00" width="290.00" height="24.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· opacus 荫光 / undulatus 波状</Text></Container></Positioned>
